erse/observations/shell-threading-conjecture.lean#L31-L36","doc":"**Sub-claim (Skein-smoothing identification)**: the (specific)\nshell energy scale `λ_shell` equals the crossing energy of\n`L_0`, the Skein smoothing at the beta-decay vertex. The\nProp is parameterless because the claim is about the\ncanonical scale, not a universally-quantified family. ","signatureChunk":0}]}